# SecurePi file contexts
# Maps filesystem paths to SELinux labels.
# Format: <path regex>  <type>  <label>
#
# Populated after first-boot audit: leave empty until then.
# Example (do not enable until the type exists in securepi.te):
#   /usr/bin/securepi-tool  --  system_u:object_r:securepi_exec_t:s0
